Error [E3501]: `fn build` must take one `BuildContext` and return `BuildPlan`.
  --> tests/ui/build_plan_invalid.jet:2:4
    |
  2 | fn build(b: BuildContext) BuildPlan! -> {
    |    ^^^^^
 Why: the build entry is a typed contract: its parameter is its authority and its result is the graph Jet executes
 Fix: write `fn build(b: BuildContext) BuildPlan`
